DANGEROUS - dense, two entrances (in the wider sense: the official shaft at D.1, and the
Coil's unofficial route surfacing at Oerath's Causeway via D.15's hidden edge). The loop
D.5-D.9-D.10-D.11-D.12-D.5 returns without reusing an edge. D.7 is the region's divide: its
two wings (D.8 alone, and D.16/D.17/D.18 together) never reconnect except by retracing
through D.7. D.6's one-way drop into D.14 is the region's one-way connection.
